                                "sense_id": "6bc8ad28-07cc-39f0-92e4-ff777e46d03c",
                                "text": "“I’ve never seen owt like it,” said Hancox. “There were flags everywhere, people on people’s shoulders, crowdsurfing. It was like human Jenga.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5b24d4d-95fd-4ca0-a0ef-6b3cf2b62282",
                                "sense_id": "6bc8ad28-07cc-39f0-92e4-ff777e46d03c",
                                "text": "You can fill your life with love / You can fill your life with owt / You can fill your lifе with food and drink / Or whatever floats your boat"
                            }
